# =============================================================================
# Section 11 — General contact analysis adapter
# =============================================================================

"""Adapt the general-contact analyzer to the orchestration pipeline.

This section connects :mod:`contacts` to the generic stage registry and result
model defined by the preceding sections. It delegates all molecular contact
search, geometric classification, residue grouping, statistics and native
DockModel attachment to ``contacts.py``. The adapter only resolves inputs and
configuration, validates the specialized result, preserves provenance and
converts the result into the common :class:`AnalysisStageResult` structure.
"""

