# =============================================================================
# Section 12 — Hydrogen-bond analysis adapter
# =============================================================================

"""Adapt hydrogen-bond analysis to the orchestration pipeline.

This section connects :mod:`hbonds` to the generic stage registry and result
model. Donor and acceptor recognition, hydrogen assignment, geometry,
classification, residue grouping, statistics and DockModel persistence remain
owned by ``hbonds.py``. The adapter resolves inputs and configuration, invokes
the specialized API, validates the native result and converts it into the
common :class:`AnalysisStageResult` representation.
"""

