# =============================================================================
# Section 13 — Hydrophobic-interaction analysis adapter
# =============================================================================

"""Adapt hydrophobic-interaction analysis to the orchestration pipeline.

This section connects :mod:`hydrophobic` to the generic stage registry and
result model. Hydrophobic atom perception, geometry, interaction detection,
classification, scoring, residue grouping, hotspot recognition, statistics
and DockModel persistence remain owned by ``hydrophobic.py``. The adapter
resolves effective inputs and configuration, invokes the specialized API,
validates the native result and exposes a stable orchestration-level output.
"""

