# =============================================================================
# Section 14 — Pi-interaction analysis adapter
# =============================================================================

"""Adapt pi-interaction analysis to the orchestration pipeline.

This section connects :mod:`pi` to the generic stage registry and result
model. Aromatic-system recognition, charged-group and amide recognition,
geometry, detection, classification, scoring, grouping, statistics and
DockModel persistence remain owned by ``pi.py``. The adapter resolves the
four supported pi-interaction subtypes, invokes the specialized API and
exposes a stable orchestration-level result without duplicating chemistry.
"""

