# =============================================================================
# Section 22 — DockModel attachment, state and cache management
# =============================================================================

"""Unified mutation, state tracking and cache support for ``DockModel``.

The specialized interaction modules remain responsible for their native result
objects and chemistry-specific attachment rules. This section adds a common
orchestration layer that records what was attached, preserves prior analysis
state, detects stale results and offers a bounded stage-result cache.
"""

